ap-kills", "text": "Enemies defeated: 0 / 10,000", "target": 10000, "left": 28, "right": 402, "overflow": 0, "visible": true }, { "id": "labmaster-rift", "text": "Highest Rift: 150 / 350", "target": 350, "left": 28, "right": 402, "overflow": 0, "visible": true }, { "id": "labmaster-lab", "text": "Lab levels: 50 / 100", "target": 100, "left": 28, "right": 402, "overflow": 0, "visible": true }, { "id": "labmaster-subjects", "text": "Different Lab subjects: 6 / 10", "target": 10, "left": 28, "right": 402, "overflow": 0, "visible": true } ], "lab": { "text": "Lab: 24 research tracks across Foundations, Wisp fundamentals, Laboratory, Expedition and Refinement. Lumen and Shards fund starts; Motes buy speed. Up to five slots unlock through Rift progress and Expanded Apparatus challenges. Each expansion needs its Rift, Ascension and completed research goals before its timer begins. Research continues for the full time away, beyond the 12-hour combat limit. Queued levels continue while Lumen and Shards are available; already-paid work finishes even if funds run out. Study Queue begins its next paid level at 1x when a slot and currency are free. Choose a speed and 8, 12 or 24 hours. The boost belongs to its slot across projects and levels; its timer continues while idle and offline. Queue Speed Up is separate: ON starts and repeats the selected boost when research and Motes are available, charging once at each start. Change the next multiplier or duration at any time; the active paid boost finishes unchanged. OFF prevents future boosts without cancelling paid time. Existing speed already paid for a level remains protected. Research Queue OFF finishes the current level, then leaves the slot empty. Selecting different research saves the current paid work; select it again to resume without paying again.", "left": 15, "right": 415, "overflow": 0, "visible": true, "focused": "lab-help" } }, { "width": 430, "scale": 1.5, "card": { "text": "12 hours of offline progressCombat rewards